        rdfs:comment                   "White square scarf with a three-banded banner: red stripe, blue stripe, and \"THERE WILL ALWAYS BE AN ENGLAND\" written in cursive between the red and blue stripes. Four British flags in the center form a central square where the same slogan is repeated. Flags from other countries (Greece, USA, Germany, etc.) surround the British flags."@en ;
